om/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p11185657_p_v11_ad.jpg"},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"Rotten Tomatoes","value":10.0,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"El Dorado: City of Gold","type":"movie","updated_at":"2026-09-25T13:30:43.530471Z","year":2019},{"backdrop":null,"genres":[],"id":"tv-tvmaze-9311","overview":"On All In with Chris Hayes, Chris Hayes delivers impactful stories that don't always make the front page. Drawing from his background as a reporter, Hayes goes on the road to uncover the truth by knocking on doors, digging deeper and speaking with people representing all points of view.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/639/1598665.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/639/1598665.jpg"},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"TVmaze","value":5.5,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"All In with Chris Hayes","type":"tv","updated_at":"2026-09-25T11:33:52Z","year":2013},{"backdrop":null,"genres":["action","adventure","anime"],"id":"anime-tvmaze-8287","overview":"In 1880s England, noble George Joestar takes in his new adopted son: young Dio Brando, whose father \"saved\" George's life 12 years ago. But instead of moving peacefully into his new home, Dio, who grew up in poverty, wants to destroy the Joestar family and gain their status for himself. What starts off as a simple feud with George's son Jonathan soon develops into a conflict that lasts well over 100 years and sends all generations of Joestars into battle against vampires, aztec deities, Nazis and shrewd serial killers.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/420/1052327.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/420/1052327.jpg"},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"TVmaze","value":7.8,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","type":"anime","updated_at":"2026-09-25T10:48:43Z","year":2012},{"backdrop":null,"genres":[],"id":"movie-rt-belle-vie","overview":"","poster":{"original_url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/gIr2_FqQkWMHIjUd38LqQ-q0rn8=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/KaxuDW3AHPNut2MGmt8kiEILJB0=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvbW92aWVzL2Y1MjBlNjYzLTRiNmMtNGUyOS04NDQ3LTBlMmE0ZmU2YjY5ZS5qcGc=","source":"rottentomatoes","url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/gIr2_FqQkWMHIjUd38LqQ-q0rn8=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/KaxuDW3AHPNut2MGmt8kiEILJB0=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvbW92aWVzL2Y1MjBlNjYzLTRiNmMtNGUyOS04NDQ3LTBlMmE0ZmU2YjY5ZS5qcGc="},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"Rotten Tomatoes","value":10.0,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Belle Vie","type":"movie","updated_at":"2026-09-25T13:30:43.530453Z","year":2022},{"backdrop":null,"genres":[],"id":"tv-tvmaze-25632","overview":"Former professional football player Andy van der Meijde and his wife, ex-playmate Melisa Schaufeli are back at SBS6 with their own reality series. The eccentric couple is packed with plans for the coming year.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/442/1105207.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/442/1105207.jpg"},"rating":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Andy & Melisa","type":"tv","updated_at":"2026-09-25T11:25:31Z","year":2014},{"backdrop":null,"genres":["comedy"],"id":"anime-tvmaze-94662","overview":"Sløth is a well-meaning stay-at-home dad striving to balance family life with his ambitions as the frontman of a heavy metal band, alongside his unconventional family navigating everyday chaos.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/642/1607079.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/642/1607079.jpg"},"rating":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Belzebubs","type":"anime","updated_at":"2026-09-25T06:27:05Z","year":2026},{"backdrop":null,"genres":[],"id":"movie-rt-sammy-davis-jr-ive-gotta-be-me","overview":"","poster":{"original_url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/Dw7HprQMm5GwlA_W0MWLaM-4Leg=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p14995949_p_v8_aa.jpg","source":"rottentomatoes","url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/Dw7HprQMm5GwlA_W0MWLaM-4Leg=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p14995949_p_v8_aa.jpg"},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"Rotten Tomatoes","value":10.0,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Sammy Davis, Jr.: I've Gotta Be Me","type":"movie","updated_at":"2026-09-25T13:30:43.530435Z","year":2019},{"backdrop":null,"genres":["drama"],"id":"tv-tvmaze-93548","overview":"Things rarely change, but everything began to change. Eun-tae, who has been working as an ordinary employee, is burnt out from everything that happens to him. Everything from work to relationships with others, his life is filled with boredom. Suddenly, he becomes a lottery winner and gets 1.3 billion won. While it is a huge amount, realistically, it is hard for him to even purchase his own house in Seoul. After reviewing everything, he decides to live his life as he used to, but with a somewhat different mindset, as he has \"insurance\" that he can depend on.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/636/1591799.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/636/1591799.jpg"},"rating":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"The Ordinary Jackpot","type":"tv","updated_at":"2026-09-25T10:26:43Z","year":2026},{"backdrop":null,"genres":["adventure","children"],"id":"anime-tvmaze-92272","overview":"In the late 1970s, in a small provincial town, girls Manyunya and Narine live a joyful and adventurous life. Their everyday life is filled with pranks, friendship, the first childhood worries, and amusing misunderstandings that invariably involve adults: the strict but kind Granny, dad Misha, and Narine's parents, Nadya and Yura. Narine's younger sister, Karinka the \"meteor,\" and her eternal \"victim,\" Rubik, join the gang, making the stories even more unpredictable. From trying to tame a kitten and fix a car to playing \"adults\" and staging their own theatrical productions, the girls learn friendship, mutual support, and responsibility. Their pranks often turn into funny and sometimes even instructive lessons, but most importantly, Manyunya and Narine always stay together, turning their childhood into a true fairy tale.","poster":{"original_url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/627/1568686.jpg","source":"tvmaze","url":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/627/1568686.jpg"},"rating":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Манюня","type":"anime","updated_at":"2026-09-25T03:35:32Z","year":2026},{"backdrop":null,"genres":[],"id":"movie-rt-ronnies","overview":"","poster":{"original_url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/dnv2KJg1iXPuL3NzL4fU6c5eGdU=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/DffzesSOqHbQkmKQtCIlsmMZWVI=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvbW92aWVzLzBiNGMyMjI1LWJlMWYtNGQxMy04OTU1LWFlNzMyODBlMmZmMy5qcGc=","source":"rottentomatoes","url":"https://resizing.flixster.com/dnv2KJg1iXPuL3NzL4fU6c5eGdU=/164x246/v2/https://resizing.flixster.com/DffzesSOqHbQkmKQtCIlsmMZWVI=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvbW92aWVzLzBiNGMyMjI1LWJlMWYtNGQxMy04OTU1LWFlNzMyODBlMmZmMy5qcGc="},"rating":{"scale":10,"source":"Rotten Tomatoes","value":10.0,"votes":null},"runtime_minutes":null,"title":"Ronnie's","type":"movie","updated_at":"2026-09-25T13:30:43.530417Z","year":2022}],"heroes":["movie-rt-el-dorado-city-of-gold","tv-tvmaze-9311","anime-tvmaze-8287","movie-rt-belle-vie","tv-tvmaze-25632","anime-tvmaze-94662","movie-rt-sammy-davis-jr-ive-gotta-be-me","tv-tvmaze-93548","anime-tvmaze-92272","movie-rt-ronnies"]}
